'''Coruscating Elixir''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Ruby Flask}}.

==Mechanics and interactions==
This flask's ability to prevent [[chaos damage]] from bypassing the character's [[energy shield]] is similar to {{il|Shavronne's Wrappings}}, {{il|Esh's Visage}} and {{il|Solaris Lorica}}. 

Any life lost by setting life to 1 is not considered damage, and accordingly does not cause a [[hit]]. 

While {{il|Righteous Fire}} normally ends when the user has 1 life remaining, using this flask will not end Righteous Fire if life is immediately recovered, for example by positive over-time life [[recovery]] from e.g. [[regeneration]]<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ts5vutcuLMU</ref> or {{psl|id=Eternal_youth_keytone2692}}'s [[recharge]],<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eLNXw6VAbGI</ref> or a source of {{c|mod|Recover #% of Life when you use a Flask}}.

{{Item acquisition}}

This item does not drop and can only be obtained via divination cards.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/1477864/page/10#p12186778|author=Zahndethus|title=Re: Unique Item List — Old Thread, New One Linked Inside|date= December 12, 2015|accessdate=March 9, 2020|publisher=Official Path of Exile Forums}}</ref>

==Ruthless mode==
Coruscating Elixir can drop anywhere in [[Ruthless mode]] (as a replacement for its [[divination card]] being disabled). It can be chanced.

Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 6.86 seconds instead.

